    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「ふぅ。ひとりでアルバイトするのってはじめてだから、意外と心細いなあ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「短期のアルバイトだから、融通は利くけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「クラスの出し物や夏祭りでやったときとは、また違った感じ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あ、次のお客さんかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-maid_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「ようこそ、『ゴシック展』へ～、ってお兄ちゃん先輩？　学校以外のところで会うなんて、珍しいですね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-maid_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「どうしたんですか、こんなところで……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あっ、もしかしてこういうのが好きだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「男のひとが行くのはちょっと恥ずかしいから、ひとりでこっそり来たとか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-maid",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-maid_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 496
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「ぜんぜん大丈夫ですよっ、けっこう男のひとも展示を見に来てるみたいですし♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ちあき",
    "text": "「あたしはここで、展示の案内をしてるんです♪」"
